!!! The HTTP request method.
!!!
!!! A choice rather than text, so a route table cannot be written against a
!!! method that does not exist and a comparison cannot quietly fail on case.
!!! Parsing text into one is the only place a spelling is judged, and it
!!! happens once, at the edge, where the request line is read.

book nilweb.http.method

public request-method begin choice
    when Get
    when Post
    when Put
    when Delete
    when Patch
    when Head
    when Options
end choice


!!! --- The wire spelling, which is always upper case.

public method-name receives verb as request-method returns text begin paragraph
    give consider verb
        when request-method.Get give "GET"
        when request-method.Post give "POST"
        when request-method.Put give "PUT"
        when request-method.Delete give "DELETE"
        when request-method.Patch give "PATCH"
        when request-method.Head give "HEAD"
        when request-method.Options give "OPTIONS"
        otherwise give "GET"
    end consider
end paragraph


!!! --- Read a method from a request line.
!!!
!!! The wire form is case-sensitive by RFC 9110, so this is an exact match and
!!! not a folded one: "get" is a malformed request, not a GET.

public parse-method receives word as text returns request-method begin paragraph
    give consider-method with word being word
end paragraph


!!! --- Whether a method was recognised at all.
!!! Separate from the parse so a caller can answer 501 rather than guess.

public is-known-method receives word as text returns boolean begin paragraph
    give word equals "GET" or word equals "POST" or word equals "PUT"
        or word equals "DELETE" or word equals "PATCH" or word equals "HEAD"
        or word equals "OPTIONS"
end paragraph


!!! --- An unknown word reads as Get so every path has a total answer; callers
!!! that care ask is-known-method first.

consider-method receives word as text returns request-method begin paragraph
    when word equals "POST" then give request-method.Post end when
    when word equals "PUT" then give request-method.Put end when
    when word equals "DELETE" then give request-method.Delete end when
    when word equals "PATCH" then give request-method.Patch end when
    when word equals "HEAD" then give request-method.Head end when
    when word equals "OPTIONS" then give request-method.Options end when
    give request-method.Get
end paragraph


!!! --- A HEAD response carries the headers of a GET and none of its body.

public body-is-suppressed receives verb as request-method returns boolean begin paragraph
    give consider verb
        when request-method.Head give true
        otherwise give false
    end consider
end paragraph
